  {
   "tag": "p",
   "y": 2269,
   "x": 100,
   "w": 850,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Mean maximum front height, recorded units · Two entries per gender per brand. Dot labels show the means; the right column shows men’s mean minus women’s."
  },
  {
   "tag": "div",
   "y": 2390,
   "x": 100,
   "w": 590,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "03 / HOW TO READ THIS"
  },
  {
   "tag": "div",
   "y": 2390,
   "x": 750,
   "w": 590,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "SOURCE & REPRODUCIBILITY"
  },
  {
   "tag": "h3",
   "y": 2416,
   "x": 100,
   "w": 590,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Measurements, not carrying capacity"
  },
  {
   "tag": "h3",
   "y": 2416,
   "x": 750,
   "w": 590,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "A balanced sample, a limited view"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "y": 2464,
   "x": 100,
   "w": 590,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "This report uses the CSV’s maximum front and back height and width fields. Each jeans entry receives equal weight. “Height” refers to the recorded maximum height, not the opening or rivet height."
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "y": 2464,
   "x": 750,
   "w": 590,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "The supplied data/measurements.csv contains 80 entries. Brand names are trimmed and compared without capitalization, combining “7 for All Mankind” and “7 for all Mankind.” Style labels are trimmed for the skinny comparison."
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "y": 2514,
   "x": 100,
   "w": 590,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "The CSV does not state measurement units, collection date, garment sizes or sampling method. Values are therefore labeled as recorded units. These dimensions do not establish usable area, volume or whether a particular phone will fit."
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "y": 2534,
   "x": 750,
   "w": 590,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Percent differences use men’s unrounded mean as the denominator. Displayed means are rounded to two decimals. The results describe this sample and should not be read as estimates for all jeans or a brand’s current range."
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "y": 2605,
   "x": 750,
   "w": 590,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "All reported findings and their pandas calculations are available in facts.json ↗ ."
  },
  {
   "tag": "span",
   "y": 2688,
   "x": 100,
   "w": 219,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "THE EVERYDAY MEASURE · POCKETS"
  },
  {
   "tag": "span",
   "y": 2688,
   "x": 1213,
   "w": 127,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Data over assumptions."
  }
